OL,3,GNEWSAWhy did double jeopardy killer
OL,4,Aconfess?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliam Dunlop had got away with murder
OL,7,F- twice.
OL,9,FSo why did he confess, and how did that
OL,10,Flead to an 800-year-old law being
OL,11,Fchanged?
OL,13,FIn 1999, Dunlop made a dramatic
OL,14,Fdisclosure to a prison guard.
OL,16,FHe was one year into a seven-year
OL,17,Fstretch for grievously wounding his
OL,18,Fpartner and her ex, when he admitted he
OL,19,Fwas also a murderer.
